        "找到<a href=\"/right-triangle-angle-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">角</a> A，即你已知的锐<a href=\"/right-triangle-angle-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">角</a>。确认它在 0 到 90 度之间。",
        "找到邻<a href=\"/right-triangle-side-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">边</a> b：与<a href=\"/right-triangle-angle-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">角</a> A 相邻且同时接触直<a href=\"/right-triangle-angle-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">角</a>的那条直角边。它通常是水平距离。",
        "找到对<a href=\"/right-triangle-side-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">边</a> a：与<a href=\"/right-triangle-angle-calculator/\" class=\"text-primary hover:underline\">角</a> A 直接相对的那条直角边。这就是你要求的值。",
